<title>UK: BADMINTON-RASMUSSEN WINS WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>BADMINTON-RASMUSSEN WINS WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>GLASGOW 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peter Rasmussen of Denmark won</p>
<p>the men's singles title at the world badminton championships on Sunday, beating China's Sun Jun in the final.</p>
</text>
